## Retro

This spec mixes two concerns: scaffolding slash commands (the actual scope)
and study-playbook/update-playbook navigation (a brain-layer concern). Push
the playbook material out — into the brain-layer parent or into separate
skill/command specs. Slash-command scaffolding itself is small: byte-faithful
template render through initContent into the right namespace folder, per-file
idempotency.
